# Large / re-fetchable Boltz prediction tensors — do NOT commit.
# We keep text provenance (ipSAE *.txt, confidence_*.json, ESM scan *.tsv) but
# drop the heavy structure/PAE arrays.
*.npz
*.cif
her2_full.fasta
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
*.bak

# NOTE: no blanket `out/` or `cofold/` rule — the ESM scan score TSVs
# (esm_scan/out/*.tsv) and the per-variant ipSAE text outputs + confidence JSON
# (cofold/<variant>/*) are intentionally tracked as provenance. The large Boltz
# predictions (*.cif/*.npz) are still excluded by the patterns above.
